			"notes": "## Added\n- Turkish translation (#9 by @NeoxyBox)\n- Ukrainian translation (#15 by @unroman)\n- Pine boats (#8)\n- [1.19+] Pine chest boats\n- [1.20.1] Pine hanging signs\n- Tag translations for EMI\n- Pine cones and pine cone jam\n\n## Changed\n- Updated to Minecraft 1.20.1\n- You can use pine leaves on pine shrub logs to add leaves to them (#6)\n- Crafting planks from pine shrub logs now yields 2 planks instead of 4\n- Tags, recipes and recipe advancements are now generated with Minecraft's data generator\n\n## Fixed\n- Missing translation for wall signs (#19)\n- Feature order cycles (#14)\n- Powder snow going to bedrock (#17)\n- Pine shrub log particles being green (#5)\n- Mire water fog colour (#11)\n- Pine trees extending underground\n- Pine snag branches being placed on dirt"
		},
